[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 102 - Counters are not damage
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:The opponent's Glistener Elf (1/1 infect) is attacking you. You control Zilortha, Strength Incarnate (lethal damage to your creatures is set by power) and Sworn Guardian (1/3). End the turn with Sworn Guardian on your battlefield carrying a -1/-1 counter.
Rule:rulesguru-270ab6989abae7ef | Infect damage to a creature becomes -1/-1 counters, not marked damage (CR 702.90c), so Zilortha's lethal-damage check finds no damage on the 0-power Guardian
